sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant Demo as Demo builder
    participant Train as Learning Brain
    participant Drive as Workspace storage
    User->>CLI: coding test-model DIRECTORY
    CLI->>Demo: Create CPU workspace
    Demo->>Drive: Save tokenizer and initialized weights
    Demo->>Train: Start bounded training
    Train->>Drive: Save checkpoint and job metadata
    Train-->>CLI: Return job result
    CLI-->>User: Print JSON with job ID
